OL,3,GNEWSADoes 'rewilded' land need better
OL,4,Awildfire prevention measures?
OL,5,
OL,6,FAs we're driving in a pickup truck to
OL,7,Fsee the aftermath of a huge fire which
OL,8,Fburnt for more than a month in the
OL,9,FCairngorms, I spot fresh smoke coming
OL,10,Ffrom the ground.
OL,12,FMy guide - RSPB Scotland's site manager
OL,13,Fat the Abernethy nature reserve, Ben
OL,14,FOliver-Jones - puts the vehicle in
OL,15,Freverse and we jump out to see what's
OL,16,Fhappening.
OL,23,APub: 25-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB  Scot NewsC Reg TVF  Weather
FL,430,420,260,160,0,100
