OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F429A1787730947
OL,1,W5j 5Qwsj#%7k"k#j  w{j#57i
OL,2,W//%*// //%Q,.*,%-. * *,$%** %-& (,,,,,,
OL,3,GNEWSADoes 'rewilded' land need better
OL,4,Awildfire prevention measures?
OL,5,
OL,6,FIt's one of several hot-spots which
OL,7,Fkeeps emerging a full week after
OL,8,Ffirefighters left the scene, which Ben
OL,9,Flikens to a game of whack-a-mole in an
OL,10,Falready charred landscape where the
OL,11,Fsmell of burning still hangs heavily in
OL,12,Fthe air.
OL,14,FBut while the small pockets of
OL,15,Fsmouldering vegetation are still being
OL,16,Fdealt with, attention is turning to
OL,17,Fimproving wildfire protection.
OL,23,APub: 25-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
OL,24,ANext PageB  Scot NewsC Reg TVF  Weather
FL,430,420,260,160,0,100
